# Build output
/target
*.pdb

# Local configuration. Aether needs no credentials and `.env.example` carries every
# value it reads, but a local file is where an operator position, a different feed, or
# a tuning experiment ends up — none of which belong in a commit.
.env

# Run artefacts: the operator picture is written to stdout, so captured sessions land
# here as ANSI-laden logs. Useful locally, noise in a repository.
*.log
*.err
